  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Connecting Blue Economy and Maritime Security</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project &#x2018;Connecting Blue Economy and Maritime Security&#x2019; aims on providing guidance and work in co-creation with local public-private partners. This is to develop and agree on ambitions, goals and starting points on the Blue economy, safety and security in the maritime domain for cooperation and development of an integrated project plan during sprint 2.With this project, the project partners are making a start towards a good dialogue between private and public stakeholders within Blue Economy and maritime security in Zanzibar and/or Tanzania. The project will start on November 7, 2022.</narrative>
  </description>
